% Predicates taking a clausal (propositional) argument: some ARGn of the
% predicate is a handle qeq to the embedded clause's eventuality (believed
% that S, doubted whether S).
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_PropositionalArguments/):
%   [ARG* h1]
%   h2:[ARG0 e]
%   { h1 =q h2 }

pattern { P -[1=ARG1|ARG2|ARG3|ARG4, post=H]-> V; V [cvarsort="e"] }
